<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SUPER 12 RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and standings after</p>
<p>round five of the Super 12 rugby union tournament:</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>ACT beat Northern Transvaal 38-19</p>
<p>Wellington beat Gauteng Lions 37-35</p>
<p>Natal beat NSW 28-23</p>
<p>Canterbury beat Waikato 24-15</p>
<p>Free State beat Otago 49-18</p>
<p>Auckland beat Queensland 49-26</p>
<p>Table (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, points for,</p>
<p>points against, bonus points, total points :</p>
<p>    Gauteng Lions	 5   4   0   1   186   149    4    20</p>
<p>    Auckland		4   3   1   0   139    97    2    16</p>
<p>    Natal		   4   3   0   1   178   137    4    16</p>
<p>    ACT		     5   3   0   2   173   146    4    16</p>
<p>    Free State	    5   3   0   2   164   130    2    14</p>
<p>    Waikato		 5   3   0   2   118   110    0    12</p>
<p>    Wellington	    4   2   0   2   136   109    3    11</p>
<p>    Canterbury	    4   2   0   2    80   106    1     9</p>
<p>    Northern Transvaal  5   1   1   3   112   172    2     8</p>
<p>    New South Wales     4   1   0   3   101   105    2     6</p>
<p>    Otago		   4   1   0   3   117   178    2     6</p>
<p>    Queensland	    5   0   0   5    88   153    1     1</p>
<p>Note: Gauteng Lions formerly Transvaal.</p>
